{
 "_doc": "Corvane Mining Co. Larkspur Exploration Adit (ADR-0044): the Corvane caves' entrance in D6 at the foot of the Larkspur cliffs. A mine office, changehouse and hoist house on a small pad; below, buried levels run west under the cliff: No. 1 Level (a timbered drift, the powder magazine, the refuge station, the winze station) and No. 2 Level (the stope, and the limestone cave the stope broke into, where the Bloom came up). Route: the office is bolted -> the hoist house door hangs off -> the office for the magazine key -> down the manway -> the drift (jaws between the rails) -> the magazine -> the refuge station: the winze key on the shift boss (taking it wakes the trapped crew) -> the winze gate (cans on it) -> down to the stope (its crew wakes on the loose boards) -> the breach into the cave -> the grotto (the Bloom's mother growth; the shift boss's foreman, guardian) -> back up, out through the office.",
