   "story": "Corvane Mining Co. drove an exploration adit under the Larkspur cliffs, chasing the same ore body as the Deep Mine. Thirty metres in, the No. 2 Level stope broke into an open limestone cave nobody had mapped. The crew sealed the breach, the company sent a survey team, and the survey team sent samples to the Program. Then the shift that went down to reopen the breach didn't come up, and the ones who went after them sealed themselves in the refuge station.",
